- ✅ `[GeneratedRegex]` used for 3 core patterns (L13, L16, L19) with proper `#if` guard
- ✅ `IsAllUpperCase` uses `foreach` loop instead of LINQ `.All()` (L159)
- ✅ `IsAsciiAlphanumeric` and `WordCount` are allocation-free foreach loops
